            CALCUL13=(TOTALCLIENT1+TOTALCLIENT2+TOTALCLIENT3+TOTALCLIENT4+TOTALCLIENT5+TOTALCLIENT6+TOTALCLIENT7+TOTALCLIENT8+TOTALCLIENT9+TOTALCLIENT10+TOTALCLIENT11+TOTALCLIENT12)
            
